1
00:00:00,148 --> 00:00:03,568
(Penny:)Um, yeah. Starting with the champagne
a little early, aren't you?

2
00:00:03,735 --> 00:00:06,575
(Raj:)It was in the limo.
They sent a limo. I have a limo.

3
00:00:06,738 --> 00:00:09,278
I just love saying "limo." Here.

4
00:00:09,699 --> 00:00:12,409
(Raj:)- Sip on this while you're getting ready.
- Oh, I'm ready.

5
00:00:13,119 --> 00:00:14,869
That's what you're wearing?

6
00:00:16,581 --> 00:00:18,831
Um, yeah. Why? What's wrong with it?

7
00:00:19,208 --> 00:00:24,718
(Raj:)Nothing. I was just hoping for something
a little more, you know, ridonkulous.

8
00:00:30,845 --> 00:00:35,015
Yeah. Well, this is all the "donkulous"
you're gonna get tonight.

9
00:00:35,850 --> 00:00:38,230
Okey-dokey. Let's roll.

10
00:00:38,394 --> 00:00:41,024
All right, it's time to raise the roof.
Ooh-ooh.

11
00:00:42,565 --> 00:00:43,695
(Penny(to Leonard who is just coming up the stairs):)Hey, Leonard.

12
00:00:43,858 --> 00:00:44,938
- Hey.
- Dude.

13
00:00:45,109 --> 00:00:48,699
- You look very nice.
BOTH: Thank you.

14
00:00:50,406 --> 00:00:52,366
(Penny:)- Come on. Good night, Leonard.
- Good night.

15
00:00:52,533 --> 00:00:56,203
- Leonard, did you see my limo downstairs?
- Yeah.

16
00:00:56,370 --> 00:00:59,020
(Raj:)It's bigger than the house
my grandfather grew up in.

